<title>NORWAY: Swedish-German yield spread could narrow - Asbrink.</title>
<headline>Swedish-German yield spread could narrow - Asbrink.</headline>
<dateline>BERGEN, Norway 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Finance Minister Erik Asbrink said on Monday conditions existed for a narrower spread between longer Swedish and German debt yields.  </p>
<p>&quot;If people look at economic fundamentals I think there are conditions for debt yield margins to decrease further,&quot; Asbrink told journalists at a conference with Nordic and Baltic finance ministers.</p>
<p>He would not say by how much the margin could decrease.</p>
<p>-- Erik Aronsson, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1010</p>
</text>
